## Project Objectives

Development of a hybrid quantum-classical computing platform for enterprise optimization problems, leveraging quantum computing capabilities for materials simulation, logistics optimization, and financial modeling.

### Key Deliverables
1. Quantum computing access platform
2. Hybrid algorithm library
3. Enterprise integration SDK
4. Use case implementations (5 verticals)
5. Training and certification program

